{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8000_place", "source_sha256": "8e8559b34e492b7c5ab25f94a298af6a4d51648308781f8ea2b669321f3177dd", "ja": "ダイニングバー", "zh": "餐酒吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8001_p", "source_sha256": "8b1e873c5fa9001720f9eea2a7451bd2108a1e90a32a41be1ef56c021511866e", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画。\n『バーテンダー』をテーマに、志保が撮影に挑む）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划。志保将以“调酒师”为主题进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8002_033sih", "source_sha256": "67840082e2ebf3cbad062a118dcf8c8ce41ec0978cd1ecc91cbe6436b24f2ba7", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。私、大丈夫\nでしょうか？　少し浮いている気がしていて……。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。我这样\n没问题吗？总觉得有点格格不入……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8003_p", "source_sha256": "707d2da376747b93d43d300fd8980e5e7e295d96bffffd5d9fdb6b9069ef85cf", "ja": "本格的なセットだから、そう思うかもしれないけど。\n志保なら大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "可能是因为布景做得很正式，所以你才会这么觉得吧。不过，志保的话没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8004_033sih", "source_sha256": "6c9f40ed4f10d6f6702f302a4ce120df0183cdd33d3756b4b54dc99803bbc05d", "ja": "そうだといいですけど。本物のバーテンダーさんを\n見たことがないので、イメージはできても……。", "zh": "要是那样就好了。因为我没见过真正的酒吧调酒师，所以即使能想象出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8005_033sih", "source_sha256": "ecc182577e7241775db4d16582419c970872ad4b2b1e2b6e47ded28a061c76c8", "ja": "そのイメージもぼんやりしていて……。\n{$P$}さんは、バーによく行きます？", "zh": "那个印象也很模糊……\n{$P$}先生经常去酒吧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8006_p", "source_sha256": "2c373f8e29f0baa3955aaff2fd937857aa62997c487da4350a1b2d73420215d0", "ja": "よく行く、ってほどではないかな……。\nまあ、付き合いで行くことはあるけど。", "zh": "倒也谈不上经常去吧……\n不过，出于交际应酬倒是有去过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8007_033sih", "source_sha256": "90d90359568b034075471149991ed882f14c548aff984e9ab25dbe8eca3deae7", "ja": "よかった。それなら軽くでいいので、\nバーテンダーさんを演じてみてくれませんか？", "zh": "太好了。那稍微试一下就行，\n能不能请您演一下调酒师呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8008_033sih", "source_sha256": "0cbf61fad1bc215ed506abb5cb173683fa1da135d1793efd5d3e71513c5e3e48", "ja": "自分のイメージと、違いがないか確かめたくて。\nお願いします。", "zh": "我想确认一下，这和我想象的有没有出入。\n拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8009", "source_sha256": "5f4424c38c85a7473de1e1a398022775dc606e01ab8f340355cc0a9c7bd24a8d", "ja": "ノリノリで", "zh": "兴致高昂地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8010", "source_sha256": "93ff3cfbe0e5579c2007b02b4900193c45965366b5bd601e28a5942a66712be3", "ja": "いつも通り", "zh": "照常", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8011", "source_sha256": "72935e71cef9fd2e3712b709cd4c3f10532027010b313d95e8c6e287fcb04055", "ja": "時間をもらう", "zh": "获取时间", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8100_p", "source_sha256": "e6be65ddc29097fc49931dd3973ab84660eb9afbf5743fe3e8b51d674b41977b", "ja": "「いらっしゃいませ。……おや、何か悩みごとですか？\n私で良ければ相談に乗りますよ。何でもお話ください」", "zh": "“欢迎光临。……哎呀，您有什么烦恼吗？\n如果您不介意的话，我可以听您倾诉。请尽管告诉我吧。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8101_033sih", "source_sha256": "2e46c071bf6eafa5135157de91004bfec60f339e96268260804942c2245453a7", "ja": "……！　そ、そうなんです、実は……上手く\nバーテンダーさんの演技ができるか、少し心配で。", "zh": "……！是、是的，其实……我有点担心\n自己能不能演好调酒师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8102_p", "source_sha256": "bbf217ed112c2b7c2a07ba5b1862a9d28b9a63923af819f0305b7d5c3d91e62b", "ja": "「大丈夫ですよ。肩肘張らず、リラックスして……\n普段通りのあなたで挑めば、きっと成功しますから」", "zh": "“没问题的。不用绷得太紧，放松一点……\n拿出平时的你去发挥，就一定会成功的”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8103_033sih", "source_sha256": "d5020bfb1019238c25f68ba56fe5a321011ddbf0fa7dd7d204c06c8f761a27ac", "ja": "は、はい。……{$P$}さん、\nありがとうございます。少し楽になりました。", "zh": "是、是的。……{$P$}先生，\n谢谢您。我感觉轻松多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8104_033sih", "source_sha256": "3a044489d7e1e72b45c424cca426018bbe57599c5d0eddaa32e4612640025da4", "ja": "普段通りを意識して、やってみますね。\nあと……今の感じ、良かったと思いますよ。ふふ。", "zh": "我会注意保持平时的状态，试试看的。\n还有……我觉得刚才那样挺好的。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8200_p", "source_sha256": "3f96557523db942ca04f10be35f62789b6a2e81d441d60dc2860d9ae169cd0e1", "ja": "「いらっしゃいませ、こちらの席へどうぞ。ご注文は\nいかがいたしますか？」……こんな感じ、だったかな？", "zh": "“欢迎光临，请到这边的座位。您想点些什么？”……大概是这种感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8201_033sih", "source_sha256": "b2c48b41afe9b4abb3384425b1a13821c030a5b3d72071ac17940f82b973d519", "ja": "思ったより普通ですね。普段の\n{$P$}さんそのまま、というか。", "zh": "比想象的要普通呢。或者该说，\n和平时的{$P$}先生没什么两样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8202_p", "source_sha256": "749618ee1529e76d6e7edf085a8e71948f723e17f3dd5f71b64ed4a1b0f52fb6", "ja": "うっ……アドリブはどうもな。とにかく、\n志保はいつも落ち着いてるし、自然体でいいと思うよ。", "zh": "唔……即兴发挥实在是不太拿手。总之，\n志保平时一直都很沉稳，我觉得保持自然的状态就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8203_033sih", "source_sha256": "64053343965f01a9275032b0785020457879135d5a766789665245cf052daded", "ja": "確かに。慣れないことをしたら、逆に失敗するかも。\n今の{$P$}さんみたいに。ふふ。", "zh": "确实。要是做不熟悉的事，反而可能会出错。\n就像刚才的{$P$}先生一样。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8300_p", "source_sha256": "cdd238a6984265e8a619065f7339ea4ab2ade6b2da9cf4ea1db4f3590cfc669e", "ja": "む、難しいな。とっさに演技を求められると……。\nごめん、ちょっと時間をもらってもいいか？", "zh": "挺、挺难的啊。突然要我演的话……\n抱歉，能稍微给我点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8301_033sih", "source_sha256": "b968c3beb0c73896d39cab4b039b97e7409df58a9c98d1b8ba381f6cff3dbc8c", "ja": "あっ。時間切れみたいです。\nすぐに撮影が始まるみたいですね。はあ……仕方ない。", "zh": "啊。看来时间到了。\n好像马上就要开始拍摄了呢。唉……真没办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_8302_033sih", "source_sha256": "c88a56dca80e60567cd2ceb2707597d120d34cc37f7fc48df0b7885c57042c6c", "ja": "できれば、参考になる演技が見たかったんですけど……\n今日は自分のイメージだけで、何とかしてみます。", "zh": "要是可以的话，本来还想看看能作为参考的演技……\n今天就只凭自己的想象，想办法试试看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
